# Bake-off data lives outside the repository (bakeoff/PROTOCOL.md). These patterns are a second
# line of defence in case a recording, transcript or result is ever copied in by mistake.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.webm
*.flac
*.tsv
bakeoff/**/manifest.csv
!bakeoff/templates/manifest.csv
bakeoff/results/
bakeoff/transcripts*/
bakeoff/labels/
bakeoff/audio/
